Package: kpp2019
Title: Kenya Population Projections 2019
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: 
    person("David", "Kariuki", , "hello@damurka.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0003-6159-1107"))
Description: Provides population projection data for Kenya and its 47
    counties from 2020 to 2045, derived from the 2019 Kenya Population
    and Housing Census and subsequent projections published by the
    Kenya National Bureau of Statistics (KNBS). Includes annual and
    five-year age and sex distributions, along with components of
    population change such as births, deaths, and migration.
